  "who": {
    "text": "Who Are We? Beauty of Joseon started with a single question: What if we took the history of Hanbang and transformed it into skincare you’d want to carry everywhere and show all your beauty-obsessed friends? With the launch of our now-iconic Relief Sun, we changed the way you thought about sunscreen. Everything we’ve created continues this key philosophy: beauty essentials that are not only easy to use and intriguing, but also deliver the results to back up the hype. We’re grateful that you’ve shared our love for elegant, joyful skincare inspired by Hanbang—and we hope you’ll continue joining us on this journey, every step of the way. The Beauty of Joseon Team",
